flowchart TB
  T[Tier M task]:::main --> Q{New API or protocol, or reshaping drifted code?}:::main
  Q -->|new surface| DL1[Invariant table]:::main --> DD[Divergent agent D: 3 designs, then compare]:::diverge --> PROTO[Prototype holds invariants]:::main --> ADV[Adversarial read: review, Codex else fresh Claude]:::fresh --> WALK[Walkthrough to maintainer, posting gate]:::gate --> OK{Maintainer OK?}:::ext
  Q -->|reshaping| MAP[Finality A: mapper X, map.md]:::reader --> IMG[Finality B: pinnacle shape, X continued]:::reader --> PH[Finality B and a half: phantom-fix hunt, X continued]:::reader --> RATE
  Q -->|neither| RATE[Rate approaches]:::main
  OK -->|yes| RATE
  OK -->|no| DL1
  RATE --> STK{Feature also fixes base bugs?}:::main
  STK -->|yes| BOT[Bottom PR: the fixes, own pipeline; top merges it in]:::main --> BUILD
  STK -->|no| BUILD[Build in behavior-preserving commits, gates, evidence, product lanes]:::main
  BUILD -.->|repro, tests, benchmarks with a time budget| LX[Local model, max 2]:::local
  BUILD --> A1
  subgraph A1[Reader A1 per slice set: map.md as index only, fresh when its context passes half the window]
    V[Verifier brief: Loop A, all slices]:::reader --> RV[Reviewer charter, all three lenses]:::reader --> GR[Guardian charter + refactor prompt: Loop B]:::reader
  end
  A1 -->|no bug| IMPL
  A1 -->|bugs| FIXB[Fix at root, phantom gate]:::main --> A1B[A1: re-verify touched slices]:::reader
  A1B -->|new bug| FIXB
  A1B -->|dry| IMPL[Land refactor findings, one commit each]:::main --> A1C[A1: re-rate, compare pre-refactor tree vs head]:::reader
  A1C -->|regression| REV[Revert that commit, fresh verify of the slice]:::main --> A1C
  A1C -->|converged| FR[Fresh reader F per slice set, Codex first: verifier brief + reviewer charter on final head + body claims]:::fresh
  FR -->|findings| FIXB
  FR -->|CLEAN| CLOSE[Owner-Safe closure checklist, pr-steps, ready]:::main
